WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.070
Heinrich Himmler – Hitler’s Enforcer

00:00:01.070 --> 00:00:05.750
He was the quiet, efficient and oh so ruthless
architect of the Holocaust; Hitler’s most

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:07.280
loyal sycophant.

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:11.829
He ruthlessly dispatched those who stood in
his way as he rose to a position of power

00:00:11.829 --> 00:00:14.469
that was second only to the Fuhrer.

00:00:14.469 --> 00:00:19.779
In the end he spectacularly betrayed his master
– only to be felled by his own hand.

00:00:19.779 --> 00:00:25.580
In this week’s Biographics, we reveal the
cold, calculating life and death of Heinrich

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:31.090
Himmler.

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:42.120
Early Years

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:48.469
Heinrich Luitpold Himmler was born on October
7th, 1900 at Wittelsbacherstrasse 2 in Munich.

00:00:48.469 --> 00:00:52.850
He was the second of three sons to Gebhart
and Anna-Marie Himmler.

00:00:52.850 --> 00:00:58.609
Gebhart was the deputy headmaster of Landshut
High School and was a pious, pedantic man.

00:00:58.609 --> 00:01:03.840
The family was well-off but not rich and they
held a measure of prestige in the local community.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:08.060
Gebhart had previously been a tutor to the
royal Wittelsbach Princes.

00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:12.970
It was this connection that led to the great
honor of having Prince Heinrich of Bavaria

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:14.720
as Heinrich’s godfather.

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:16.840
Heinrich was not a well child.

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:20.350
He was often absent from school with one illness
or another.

00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:23.970
Still, he made up for the absences by simply
working harder.

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:26.920
By doing so, he proved himself to be excellent
student.

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:31.479
A middle school teacher remembered him as
‘a very keen pupil whose tireless application,

00:01:31.479 --> 00:01:36.570
burning ambition and active participation
in class have achieved excellent results.’

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:41.240
The man who would go on to persecute the Catholic
clergy without mercy, grew up as part of a

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:42.890
devout family of believers.

00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:44.840
As a youth he wrote in his diary . . .

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:48.110
I will always love God and remain true to
the Church.

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:50.649
As a teenager, Heinrich served as an altar
boy.

00:01:50.649 --> 00:01:54.509
When war broke out, he developed a desire
to serve his country in a military capacity.

00:01:54.509 --> 00:01:59.390
Gebhart, a fervent nationalist, approved and
tried to use his royal contact to smooth his

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:01.320
son’s path to becoming an officer.

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:07.520
However, the seventeen-year-old was turned
down by the Imperial Navy due to his short-sightedness.

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:12.470
He next turned to the army, gaining entry
and being sent to officer training school.

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:16.190
But before he had completed his cadetship,
the war was over.

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:21.571
Unlike the Fuhrer he would come to adore,
Himmler saw none of the carnage of the Great

00:02:21.571 --> 00:02:25.350
War first hand.

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:30.020
The Emerging Nazi

00:02:30.020 --> 00:02:38.150
In April, 1919, Himmler joined one of the
many Freikorps army units that were determined

00:02:38.150 --> 00:02:40.640
to crush the Communist movement.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:45.000
During the next two years he served in various
paramilitary organizations that were on the

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.640
march against democracy, the shameful Treaty
of Versailles and the Marxist dictatorship.

00:02:50.640 --> 00:02:54.090
Young Himmler had been frustrated that he
had not got to fight in the front lines during

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:58.990
the war and, lacking any direction, he now
sought a cause that he could embrace and a

00:02:58.990 --> 00:03:00.670
leader that he could respect.

00:03:00.670 --> 00:03:03.670
Himmler’s family had not been inherently
anti-Semitic.

00:03:03.670 --> 00:03:08.560
In his early twenties, however, he began reading
the Jew bashing pamphlets that were circulating

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:09.640
around Munich.

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:14.810
He also got ahold of the ‘Protocols of the
Elders of Zion’, a faked document that purported

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:18.040
to contain details of a Jewish world conspiracy.

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:22.000
Himmler came of age at a time when the old
order was in a state of chaos.

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:28.040
The German people were defeated, their economy
decimated and their psyche damaged irreparably.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:30.780
This caused fear and depression.

00:03:30.780 --> 00:03:35.510
In the old order, Himmler, the son of a royal
tutor, would have found a secure place in

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:36.510
society.

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:38.070
But now all bets were off.

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:40.910
He would have to forge his own path.

00:03:40.910 --> 00:03:46.040
Gerhard Himmler had instilled in his sons
the Teutonic ideal that the German Aryan was

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:47.580
the master human being.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:51.770
What Heinrich saw on the streets of Munich
in the early ‘20’s was the opposite of

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:56.510
Aryan supremacy – the people were fast sliding
into decadence and immorality.

00:03:56.510 --> 00:04:01.300
But this was no fault of the German people
– his readings convinced Himmler that the

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:07.010
country’s ills could all be laid at the
feet of one group – the Jews.

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:11.070
Himmler would spend the rest of his life championing
the Teutonic ideal.

00:04:11.070 --> 00:04:15.920
His constant refrain when faced with a situation
was, ‘What would our forefathers have done

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:17.720
in this situation?’

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:21.970
Disgusted at what had happened to his beloved
German nation, the young Himmler began making

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.090
plan to emigrate.

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:26.930
On November 23rd, 1921 he wrote the following
in his diary . . .

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:31.430
Today I cut an article from the newspaper
about emigration to Peru.

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:35.390
Where will I end up: Spain, Turkey, the Baltic
countries, Russia, Peru?

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:36.940
I often think about it.

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:40.180
In two years’ time I will no longer be in
Germany.

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:44.770
A year later he was still in Germany, but
the dream of living abroad was still with

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:45.770
him.

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:50.560
In 1922 he enquired at the Soviet Embassy
about moving to the Ukraine as an estate manager.

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:55.370
Two decades later he would send his death
squads into the Ukraine to decimate the land

00:04:55.370 --> 00:05:01.020
and wipe out its Jewish inhabitants, but for
now his greatest ambition was to be a peaceful

00:05:01.020 --> 00:05:02.560
agricultural manager.

00:05:02.560 --> 00:05:07.100
By the end of 1922, Himmler had completed
a degree in agriculture and settled into a

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:10.320
job as an agricultural assistant in a fertilizer
factory.

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:17.410
Then, in 1923, he joined the Nationalist Socialist
Worker’s Party.

00:05:17.410 --> 00:05:21.930
He started off as a member of the paramilitary
unit under Ernst Rohm and played a part in

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:25.890
the unsuccessful Beer Hall Putsch attempt
to seize power.

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:29.340
The police threw several people, including
Hitler himself, in prison.

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:33.150
Himmler was questioned but then released through
lack of evidence.

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:38.330
But his involvement in the attempted revolt
led to him losing his job as an agricultural

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:39.330
analyst.

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:42.860
With no money coming in, he had to move back
in with his parents.

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:46.580
Around this time, Himmler appears to have
fallen into a depressive state.

00:05:46.580 --> 00:05:50.330
He had few friends and portrayed an aggressive,
volcanic personality.

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:55.240
The Catholic religion, which had been so dear
to him, was abandoned and a fascination with

00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:57.300
the occult began to take shape.

00:05:57.300 --> 00:06:02.260
Unlike a lot of other new recruits to the
Nazi party, Himmler was not immediately overawed

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:03.990
by the presence of Adolf Hitler.

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:07.810
His adoration of the Fuhrer developed over
time.

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:12.170
As was his nature, Himmler read everything
he could about and by Hitler.

00:06:12.170 --> 00:06:27.940
He came to appreciate him first on an intellectual
level – the worship would come soon enough.

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:28.940
The Loyal Worker

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:32.639
The now unemployed twenty-five-year-old began
putting all of his energies into the cause

00:06:32.639 --> 00:06:33.639
of national socialism.

00:06:33.639 --> 00:06:38.990
He took on the position of secretary for Gregor
Strasser, a pharmacist from Landshut who was

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:41.200
standing as a candidate for the Reichstag.

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:46.810
In return for a monthly salary of 120 Reichsmarks
he travelled around Lower Bavaria on his motorcycle

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:50.370
and gave inflammatory speeches against Jews
and Communists.

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:54.980
Strasser was a Nazi party member who was attempting
to wrest control of the organization from

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:56.400
the imprisoned Hitler.

00:06:56.400 --> 00:07:01.060
Believing that he would succeed, Himmler supported
Strasser in this internal power struggle.

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:05.501
In the early ‘20’s the notoriously shy
Heinrich, found his fraulien – a nurse from

00:07:05.501 --> 00:07:07.310
Bromberg named Marga.

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:12.430
Tall blond and blue-eyed, she fit the Teutonic
ideal and matched Himmler’s ideal image

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:13.710
of Germanic womanhood.

00:07:13.710 --> 00:07:19.040
The couple were married on July 3rd, 1928
with Marga bringing a sizeable dowry to the

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.040
union.

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:23.270
This financial windfall enabled Heinrich to
realize his dream of owning his own piece

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:27.490
of land and they purchased a chicken farm
at Wadltrudering not far from Munich.

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:31.810
During this time, Himmler managed to rise
rapidly in his standing within the party.

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:37.360
By 1926 he was deputy head of Reich propaganda
and then deputy Reichsfuhrer-SS.

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:41.800
By then Hitler had been released from prison,
brushed aside the internal threat from Strasser

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:44.810
and published his tome, Mein Kampf.

00:07:44.810 --> 00:07:48.300
Himmler effortlessly switched his allegiance
back to Hitler.

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:53.320
He devoured Mein Kampf, commenting that it
contained an extraordinary number of truths.

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:59.710
Very quickly, Himmler’s loyalty to Hitler
became absolute.

00:07:59.710 --> 00:08:07.480
The SS

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:12.420
By the mid-1920’s Hitler came to the realization
that he was in need of a special protection

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:13.420
force.

00:08:13.420 --> 00:08:18.050
He needed a squad of men who gave him unquestioned
loyalty and were even prepared to march against

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:20.030
their brothers if needed.

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:25.030
To head such a force no one was as fervently
devoted and therefore so eminently suited

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:26.650
as Heinrich Himmler.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:31.340
On January 6th, 1929, Hitler appointed Himmler
to the position of Reichsfuhrer-SS.

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:37.140
At that time, the SS was a small division
of the larger SA, which was under the headship

00:08:37.140 --> 00:08:38.430
of Ernst Rohm.

00:08:38.430 --> 00:08:40.390
The SA was Hitler’s private army.

00:08:40.390 --> 00:08:45.110
The fighting quality of its men was questionable,
but Rohm saw its strength coming from force

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:46.110
of numbers.

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:49.200
In contrast, the SS was a far more elite force.

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:54.460
Its members wore black peaked caps emblazoned
with a skull along with black bordered swastika

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:55.460
armbands.

00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:57.730
The new position was ideal for Himmler.

00:08:57.730 --> 00:09:02.270
From his youth he had admired and been fascinated
by the Praetorian Guard that were the elite

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:04.390
protection force of Roman emperors.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:08.860
Now he had the opportunity to craft his own
modern day Praetorian Guard.

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:12.080
He immediately began putting his own stamp
on the SS.

00:09:12.080 --> 00:09:14.700
He had belt buckles made that were in scripted
with the words . . .

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.700
SS man, loyalty is thy honor.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:21.240
He also came up with a succinct motto for
his men . . .

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:23.580
Be more than you seem.

00:09:23.580 --> 00:09:27.080
When Himmler assumed leadership, the SS numbered
around 200 men.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:30.000
A year later it had grown to just over a thousand.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:33.710
By June, 1934 it had swollen to 50,000.

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:37.860
In 1931, Himmler created a unit within the
unit.

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:44.330
It was called 1C and was put under the leadership
of new rising star Reinhard Heydrich.

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:48.830
Later to become the secret service, this was
the organ by which Hitler could have undercover

00:09:48.830 --> 00:10:01.830
surveillance undertaken within the party.

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:02.830
Night of the Long Knives

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:05.770
By 1934, the SA under Ernst Rohm had become
redundant to Hitler.

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:09.120
Now that he was Chancellor he had no need
for a bunch of street thugs.

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:13.270
In fact, his association with them was bound
to be damaging to his career.

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:15.740
It was time to break this private army up.

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:19.830
Himmler was delighted with the news that the
SA, along with its commander Ernst Rohm, were

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:21.070
about to be dealt with.

00:10:21.070 --> 00:10:25.790
For five years he had been a subordinate to
the uncouth and unorganized Rohm, whom he

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:28.070
considered his social inferior.

00:10:28.070 --> 00:10:32.170
Himmler threw himself into planning the overthrow
of the SA that history would recall as the

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:34.210
Night of the Long Knives.

00:10:34.210 --> 00:10:38.060
Documents were forged to show that the SA
were planning a coup and Himmler personally

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:40.190
took those documents to Hitler.

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:44.510
Immediately death lists were drawn up containing
the names of SA leaders as well any others

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:48.130
who were seen by Himmler and Heydrich as threats
to their growing power.

00:10:48.130 --> 00:10:50.710
At the top of the list was Ernst Rohm.

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:55.180
When Rohm was taken into custody, Hitler was
in favor of commuting the death sentence of

00:10:55.180 --> 00:11:00.570
his long-term colleague but he was brow beaten
by Himmler and Heydrich into eliminating him.

00:11:00.570 --> 00:11:03.270
This was in calling with Himmler’s underlying
nature.

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:08.440
He was a man who was completely devoid of
scruples, lacking any of the normal inhibitions

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:13.300
or pangs of conscience that would cause others
to pause in their actions.

00:11:13.300 --> 00:11:18.560
The arrests, torment and murders of the Night
of the Long Knives were carried out by Himmler’s

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:19.560
SS.

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:22.660
Their leader was a major beneficiary of the
operation.

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:27.140
In the wake of the purging of the SA, Himmler
took over headship of the Gestapo from Hermann

00:11:27.140 --> 00:11:28.190
Goering.

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:32.230
Around the same time, Himmler ordered the
death of Gerhard Strasser the man he had earlier

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:40.490
supported as Nazi Party leader and who had
been his employer.

00:11:40.490 --> 00:11:45.940
Total Power

00:11:45.940 --> 00:11:50.130
By 1935, Himmler was in a position of great
power within the Nazi state.

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:55.140
As well as heading the SS and Gestapo, he
was also in command of the entire German police

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:56.140
force.

00:11:56.140 --> 00:11:59.260
This enabled him to participate in Cabinet
meetings with all the rights and privileges

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:01.390
of a minister of the Reich.

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:06.970
On October 11th, 1936, Himmler gave a speech
in front of the academy of German Law in which

00:12:06.970 --> 00:12:11.380
he made it clear how he was to run the country’s
police and defense forces . . .

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:15.760
Whether or not our actions conflict with a
particular article or sub-section is a matter

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:17.540
of complete indifference to me.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:22.570
In the fulfilment of my duty, I do precisely
what I can answer for in my work for Fuhrer

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:26.020
and nation, and what equates with healthy
common sense.

00:12:26.020 --> 00:12:31.320
Whether or not others whined about a breach
of the law is no concern to me.

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:34.760
Hitler would only accept the very best Teutonic
men into the SS.

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:38.390
The organization was to be a racial elite
class.

00:12:38.390 --> 00:12:42.100
Himmler made sure that he saw a photo of every
applicant.

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:46.380
He meticulously scanned them in search of
anything that might give evidence of impurity.

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:50.709
Once he found his perfect specimens, he intended
to do what he could to ensure that there were

00:12:50.709 --> 00:12:51.709
more of them.

00:12:51.709 --> 00:12:57.220
And so, on October 28th, 1939, he issued his
procreation order to the SS.

00:12:57.220 --> 00:13:01.580
It was the highest duty of women and girls
to conceive children by the soldiers of the

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:03.760
SS before they went into battle.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:08.200
In other words, if a female did not submit
to the sexual demands of an SS man, she was

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:09.940
guilty of treason to the state.

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:14.630
Himmler became obsessed with the idea of procreating
the world with Pure Aryans.

00:13:14.630 --> 00:13:19.060
An order went out that every SS man was to
father at least one child.

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:21.250
He considered monogamy to be a sin.

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:25.280
His men were allowed to have several wives
in order to be able to father as many future

00:13:25.280 --> 00:13:29.760
heroes as possible.

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:37.070
Mass Murder

00:13:37.070 --> 00:13:41.420
Under Himmler, the SS became much more than
a personal bodyguard for the Fuhrer.

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:44.760
Himmler had been charged with restoring the
nation to health.

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:48.050
This task required ridding the country of
racial impurity.

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:52.930
To do this the SS would go through community
after community and cleanse it of Jews, Freemasons

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:53.930
and Jesuits.

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:59.550
But Himmler had soon extended the list of
undesirables to include Slavs, gypsies, homosexuals,

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:01.680
Jehovah’s Witnesses and Communists.

00:14:01.680 --> 00:14:06.300
When Hitler invaded Russia in 1941, Himmler
provided ‘action squads’ who would follow

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:08.870
up the regular army as it conquered the land.

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:11.890
Their job was to take out all Jews, Asiatics,
Communist and gypsies.

00:14:11.890 --> 00:14:15.610
Himmler ensured that his men keep meticulous
records of their activities.

00:14:15.610 --> 00:14:22.410
One of the squad commanders had recorded 90,000
killings in just the last few months of 1941.

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:27.220
These mass scale murders, however, presented
a problem that Himmler had to provide a solution

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:28.220
for.

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:31.650
Having to kill so many people each day was
proving challenging for the psyches of the

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:34.880
soldiers doing the work.

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:39.400
Was there a more efficient way to kill that
did not lead to such demoralization?

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:43.840
Of course, there was no question in Himmler’s
mind that the course of mass murder was morally,

00:14:43.840 --> 00:14:45.100
socially and politically correct.

00:14:45.100 --> 00:14:49.640
For year he had drilled two simple rules into
the minds of his SS . . .

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:52.340
Firstly, the Fuhrer was always right.

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:55.339
Secondly, the end justifies the means.

00:14:55.339 --> 00:15:00.970
He presented the mass extermination as a monumental
secular mission that his men were privileged

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:02.160
to be fulfilling.

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:06.310
After personally watching the execution of
200 Jews near Minsk, he said . . .

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:09.910
It is the curse of the great man to step over
corpses.

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:14.620
In the summer of 1941, Himmler summoned the
commandant of the Auschwitz Concentration

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:16.480
Camp, Rudolf Hoss to a meeting in Berlin.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:20.240
He informed him that the Fuhrer had order
the final solution to the Jewish question.

00:15:20.240 --> 00:15:25.240
The SS, he told Hoss, were to carry that order
out and he had selected Auschwitz as the prime

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:26.430
location to do it.

00:15:26.430 --> 00:15:31.769
Hoss and Adolf Eichmann were to organize the
genocide but Himmler was the man in charge.

00:15:31.769 --> 00:15:36.630
Under Himmler’s watchful gaze the concentration
camps, with Auschwitz as the shining model,

00:15:36.630 --> 00:15:39.750
became incredibly efficient death factories.

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:44.079
Those passing through the gates of the camp
were weeded, with those selected going directly

00:15:44.079 --> 00:15:45.420
to the gas chambers.

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:50.250
In less than fifteen minutes they were dead,
victims of the highly poisonous gas Zyklon

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:54.970
B. For those who were considered fit for work,
their death would come from exhaustion or

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:55.970
starvation.

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:58.769
Himmler paid a personal visit to Auschwitz
in 1942.

00:15:58.769 --> 00:16:03.730
He watched as victims were selected and watched
through a spyhole in the gas chamber door

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.470
as the executions were carried out.

00:16:05.470 --> 00:16:10.180
He did not comment on what he saw, a sign
to camp commandant Hoss that he was happy

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:11.180
with what he witnessed.

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:14.970
Himmler went on to inspect the rest of the
camp, during which time Hoss campaigned about

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:18.779
the squalid conditions and the dangers of
disease to his men.

00:16:18.779 --> 00:16:21.190
Himmler stopped him in mid-sentence and declared
. . .

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:23.410
I don’t want to hear anymore about your
difficulties.

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:27.710
For an SS officer there are no difficulties;
his duty is always to remove difficulties

00:16:27.710 --> 00:16:30.350
himself as soon as they arise.

00:16:30.350 --> 00:16:36.519
How you do it is for you to figure out, not
me.

00:16:36.519 --> 00:16:44.279
End of the Reich

00:16:44.279 --> 00:16:48.790
By mid-1944, the tide of war had turned and
the writing was on the wall for the Nazi regime.

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:52.220
Yet, Himmler’s unwavering loyalty to Adolf
Hitler was intact.

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:56.830
This, being the case, historians have noted
that it seems odd that, with his massive spy

00:16:56.830 --> 00:17:01.970
network he did not have advanced warning of
the July 20th, 1944 plot to kill Hitler.

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:05.730
Some have even speculated that he was involved
in some way.

00:17:05.730 --> 00:17:09.609
It is true that three days before the attack
he turned down a written Gestapo request for

00:17:09.609 --> 00:17:11.740
permission to arrest two of the main plotters.

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:16.199
It is also clear that the ruthlessness with
which the SS persecution machine when into

00:17:16.199 --> 00:17:20.709
action after the attack was not matched with
its usually impeccable standard of surveillance

00:17:20.709 --> 00:17:21.779
before it.

00:17:21.779 --> 00:17:26.010
It is probable that Himmler did not intend
to betray Hitler on July 20th, 1944.

00:17:26.010 --> 00:17:30.659
But that betrayal was to come, and it would
manifest itself on the Fuhrer’s birthday,

00:17:30.659 --> 00:17:33.029
April 20th, 1945.

00:17:33.029 --> 00:17:37.100
On that day, Himmler was guest along with
other high-ranking Nazis at what must surely

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:40.230
have been one of the most macabre birthday
parties in history.

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:44.820
It was held in the underground bunker that
was Hitler’s final hideout, situated in

00:17:44.820 --> 00:17:46.739
the heart of ravaged Berlin.

00:17:46.739 --> 00:17:51.269
Hitler was unaware that Himmler had a second
engagement later that day; with an emissary

00:17:51.269 --> 00:17:53.260
from the World Congress of Jewry.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:58.400
He proposed that the jews and the National
Socialists bury the hatchet and that concentration

00:17:58.400 --> 00:18:00.350
camps inmates would be handed over to the
Red Cross.

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:04.549
Just a few days earlier he had given orders
that no camp survivors were to fall into enemy

00:18:04.549 --> 00:18:07.330
hands and no camps were to be surrendered.

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:12.269
His about face was clearly a matter of expediency
in an attempt to minimize the ire of the allies

00:18:12.269 --> 00:18:16.090
when they discovered the horrors that had
been taking place under his watch.

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:20.429
Three days later, Himmler held talks with
the Swedish diplomat, Count Folke Bernadotte.

00:18:20.429 --> 00:18:25.039
Here he presented a surprising offer, saying
that, in order to save Germans from the full

00:18:25.039 --> 00:18:29.710
force of a Russian invasion he was prepared
to surrender the Western front – but not

00:18:29.710 --> 00:18:30.879
the Eastern front.

00:18:30.879 --> 00:18:35.470
Himmler believed that he could negotiate directly
with President Eisenhower and wondered out

00:18:35.470 --> 00:18:40.309
loud whether he should shake the President’s
hand or offer him a Nazi salute.

00:18:40.309 --> 00:18:44.130
Of course, Himmler’s clandestine visits
were meant to be top secret.

00:18:44.130 --> 00:18:48.850
However, somehow, they got leaked to the media
and on April 28th, London’s BBC broadcast

00:18:48.850 --> 00:18:53.350
that Himmler was claiming that Hitler was
dead and that he was his successor.

00:18:53.350 --> 00:18:56.960
In the Berlin bunker, Hitler’s adjutants
were monitoring the airwaves and this news

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:58.730
soon found its way to the Fuhrer.

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:00.360
Hitler was dumbstruck.

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:04.629
He could accept betrayal from anyone else,
but never from his loyal Himmler.

00:19:04.629 --> 00:19:09.759
He called it the most monstrous betrayal in
world history and he immediately ordered Himmler’s

00:19:09.759 --> 00:19:10.759
arrest.

00:19:10.759 --> 00:19:17.210
But within days, Hitler was dead, the victim
of his own hand.

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:25.220
An Inauspicious End

00:19:25.220 --> 00:19:29.830
On May 1st, Himmler met with Hitler’s heir,
Admiral Karl Donitz at the naval barracks

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:30.830
at Plon.

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:31.999
Donitz was wary.

00:19:31.999 --> 00:19:35.609
Even though Himmler had been deposed, there
was no telling how much allegiance the men

00:19:35.609 --> 00:19:37.320
of the SS would still give to him.

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:39.019
Himmler was shown his letter of dismissal.

00:19:39.019 --> 00:19:43.870
Ignoring it he congratulated Donitz on his
appointment and offered to work with him as

00:19:43.870 --> 00:19:44.950
his second-in-command.

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:45.950
Donitz declined.

00:19:45.950 --> 00:19:48.619
The meeting was over and Himmler was allowed
to walk away.

00:19:48.619 --> 00:19:53.960
He now resolved to go into hiding and bide
his time before coming back to lead his all-powerful

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:55.539
SS on a surge to power.

00:19:55.539 --> 00:19:59.960
On May 22nd, with the war over and Germany
under allied occupation, a British patrol

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:03.200
stopped a group of ragged looking men outside
of Hamburg.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:07.369
One of them, a short, thin man with a black
eye patch told them his name was Heinrich

00:20:07.369 --> 00:20:10.250
Hitzinger and then produced forged identity
papers.

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:12.399
He was dressed as an ordinary German soldier.

00:20:12.399 --> 00:20:14.940
The seven men were, in fact, Himmler, his
bodyguard and adjutants.

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:18.399
The British guards took the group into custody
and placed them in a prisoner of war camp

00:20:18.399 --> 00:20:19.399
just out of Bremen.

00:20:19.399 --> 00:20:23.370
It didn’t take long for the proud Himmler
to chafe under the common treatment that he

00:20:23.370 --> 00:20:25.520
was receiving as merely a captured soldier.

00:20:25.520 --> 00:20:29.009
After a few days he requested an audience
with the camp commander.

00:20:29.009 --> 00:20:32.869
Expecting to be treated with newfound dignity,
Himmler announced his true identity.

00:20:32.869 --> 00:20:37.900
But rather than being respected for his position
as the Nazi number two man, his captors treated

00:20:37.900 --> 00:20:38.970
him with contempt.

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:43.440
He was forced to strip completely and kept
under 24-hour watch to prevent his suicide.

00:20:43.440 --> 00:20:46.320
The following day Himmler was brought before
the camp commander for interrogation.

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:50.840
In his mouth he had secreted an ampoule of
poison which had been issued to all top Nazis

00:20:50.840 --> 00:20:52.229
and which they always carried with them.

00:20:52.229 --> 00:20:56.220
A body search was ordered and when a doctor
tried to examine Himmler’s mouth, he bit

00:20:56.220 --> 00:20:57.330
down on the ampoule.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:21:00.450
The enraged British tried desperately to clear
the poison from his system.

00:21:00.450 --> 00:21:01.809
But it was no good.

00:21:01.809 --> 00:21:35.909
Within twelve minutes, Himmler 

00:21:35.909 --> 00:21:37.309
was dead.

